WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.334
Now to some important breaking news.

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.202
Brand new information

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:03.603
just in to CNN about that

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:04.371
American drone

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:05.605
forced out of the sky

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:06.373
by a Russian fighter

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:07.574
jet over the Black Sea.

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:08.775
Let's get straight to CNN's Oren

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:09.676
Liebermann at the Pentagon.

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:10.910
Or and what do we know?

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.078
John, we now have a far better

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:13.546
sense of the steps the U.S.

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:14.247
took to make sure

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:15.582
there was no sensitive information

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:16.683
on that drone

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:17.984
that the Russians might be able

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:19.986
to try to recover from the Black Sea.

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:21.488
Yesterday, John Kirby,

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:22.756
the strategic coordinator

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:24.424
for the National Security Council, said

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:24.858
the U.S.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.626
had taken steps to protect its equities

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:28.328
but wouldn't go into further detail.

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:29.696
We now know from two U.S.

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.398
officials familiar with the incident.

00:00:31.398 --> 00:00:32.065
That step

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:33.666
that was taken was erasing

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.869
or wiping the software from the drone.

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:37.537
The sensitive software that runs

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:39.305
the drone end is in charge.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:40.740
Of collecting the intelligence,

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.042
collecting the signals

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:43.009
that the drone uses

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:44.911
and then passes on to the U.S.

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:45.845
upon its landing

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:47.914
remotely, the operators of the drone

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:49.682
were able to wipe the drone in a race

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:50.617
that's software

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:51.684
such that it wouldn't fall

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:52.619
into Russian hands

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:54.721
or frankly, other hands after the U.S.

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:56.623
brought it down in the Black Sea.

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:57.390
A senior Russian

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.024
official said on

00:00:58.024 --> 00:00:58.792
Russian state TV

00:00:58.792 --> 00:01:00.460
that the Russians would try to recover

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:01.194
the drone.

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:02.762
It's not the aircraft itself,

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:03.997
the hardware, if you will.

00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:05.165
That's the sensitive part.

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:06.366
It is the software,

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:08.168
and that's the step the U.S.

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:09.869
went to protect by erasing it

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:11.838
and wiping it remotely from the drone

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:14.007
before it crashed into the Black Sea.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:14.340
The U.S.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.775
doesn't have naval assets

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:17.210
or ships in the Black Sea

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:17.944
that would be able

00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:19.345
to expeditiously carry out

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:20.413
a recovery effort.

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:22.482
So this, John, is now we know the step

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:22.882
the U.S.

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:23.850
took to make sure

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:25.852
sensitive information, intelligence

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:27.620
didn't fall into the wrong hands

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:28.455
or labored life

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:30.023
for the Pentagon at the breaking news.

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:30.356
Thank you.

